[219.159556, "o", "\r\u001b[2K```\r\npython - <<'EOF'\r\nfrom transformers import AutoTokenizer\r\ntok=AutoTokenizer.from_pretrained('openai-community/gpt2')\r\nfor t in [' A',' B',' C',' D','A','B','C','D',' A.','Answer:']:\r\n print(repr(t), tok.encode(t, add_special_tokens=False), tok.convert_ids_to_tokens(tok.encode(t, add_special_tokens=False)))\r\nEOF\r\n```\r\n\u001b[32m⠦\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
