[431.242071, "o", "\r\u001b[2K\r\n\u001b[1;31mmini-swe-agent\u001b[0m\u001b[31m (step \u001b[0m\u001b[1;31m25\u001b[0m\u001b[31m, \u001b[0m\u001b[1;31m$0.00\u001b[0m\u001b[31m):\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[32m⠧\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
[431.242897, "o", "\r\u001b[2KTraining is slow because GPT-2 computes logits over the entire vocabulary at every sequence position. I'll stop it and optimize the script to compute only the \r\nanswer-position logits, which should be far faster on CPU.\r\n\r\n```\r\nkill $(cat /app/train.pid) 2>/dev/null; sleep 2; python - <<'EOF'\r\nimport inspect\r\nfrom transformers import GPT2LMHeadModel\r\nsig=inspect.signature(GPT2LMHeadModel.forward)\r\nprint(sig)\r\nprint('num_logits_to_keep' in str(sig))\r\nEOF\r\n```\r\n\u001b[32m⠧\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
[431.243151, "o", "\r\u001b[2K\u001b[32m⠧\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond...\r\n\u001b[?25h\r\u001b[1A\u001b[2K"]
[436.836145, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1;32mTool\u001b[0m:\r\n"]
[436.836461, "o", "<returncode>\r\n0\r\n<output>\r\n(self, input_ids: torch.LongTensor | None = None, past_key_values: transformers.cache_utils.Cache | None = None, attention_mask: torch.FloatTensor | None = \r\nNone, token_type_ids: torch.LongTensor | None = None, position_ids: torch.LongTensor | None = None, inputs_embeds: torch.FloatTensor | None = None, \r\nencoder_hidden_states: torch.Tensor | None = None, encoder_attention_mask: torch.FloatTensor | None = None, labels: torch.LongTensor | None = None, use_cache: \r\nbool | None = None, logits_to_keep: int | torch.Tensor = 0, **kwargs) -> transformers.modeling_outputs.CausalLMOutputWithCrossAttentions\r\nFalse\r\n\r\n"]
[436.837722, "o", "\u001b[92m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[?25l"]
